OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors 2 cast: Who are this
OL,4,Ayear's 'big dogs' and dark horses?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCelebrity Traitors returns next week
OL,7,Ffor a second round of deception and
OL,8,Famateur detective work.
OL,10,FHosted by Claudia Winkleman, the
OL,11,FTraitors castle will welcome 21 new
OL,12,Fcelebrities on Thursday, as a group of
OL,13,Ffamous "faithfuls" attempts to work out
OL,14,Fwhich among them are - and perhaps,
OL,15,Falways have been - "traitors", secretly
OL,16,Fmurdering contestants each night.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790565491
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors 2 cast: Who are this
OL,4,Ayear's 'big dogs' and dark horses?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year's show provided Bafta's most
OL,7,Fmemorable TV moment - an award voted
OL,8,Ffor by the British public - when
OL,9,Ftraitor Alan Carr broke down in tears
OL,10,Fat the end of the final having bluffed
OL,11,Fhis way to a win by hiding in plain
OL,12,Fsight.
OL,14,FLet's have a stab in the dark, then, at
OL,15,Fwho might follow in Jonathan Ross's
OL,16,Ffootsteps as this year's "big dog", and
OL,17,Fwho, like singer Cat Burns, could fly
OL,18,Funder the radar?
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
